@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `pti268-nouns`

-- FIXTURES for the tests: builders for contracts, persons, events, treatments, items and
-- claims. No rule and no assertion lives here.
--
-- EVERY FIGURE IN THIS FILE IS A SCENARIO VALUE, NOT THE DOCUMENT'S: the schedule's sums
-- insured and limits, the premium, the rate of exchange and the dates are hypothetical,
-- chosen to make the arithmetic of the tests visible. The document leaves all of them to the
-- contract (NOTES.md, section 1). The figures the DOCUMENT states (30, 60, 120, 210, 365
-- days; 10%, 20%, 50%, 80%; VND 500.000 and 200.000; USD 50 000 and 20 000; the table) are
-- never written here; the tests that check them write them beside the assertion.

§ `Fixtures`

§§ `The schedule and the contract`

-- A hypothetical schedule.
GIVETH A `The limits in the schedule`
`the scenario schedule` MEANS
    `The limits in the schedule` WITH
        `sum insured under Benefit 1`     IS 100000000
        `limit of Benefit 2`              IS 20000000
        `sum insured under Benefit 3`     IS 50000000
        `limit of Benefit 4`              IS 40000000
        `surgery limit within Benefit 4`  IS 20000000
        `room and board limit per day`    IS JUST 1000000
        `basis of the daily allowance`    IS `a fixed daily allowance` 200000
        `days of allowance chosen`        IS 60
        `limit of Benefit 6`              IS 10000000
        `transport level`                 IS `Level A`
        `funeral allowance`               IS JUST 5000000

GIVEN basis IS A `A basis of daily allowance`
      level IS A `A level of transport cover`
GIVETH A `The limits in the schedule`
`the scenario schedule with allowance on` basis `and transport at` level MEANS
    `The limits in the schedule` WITH
        `sum insured under Benefit 1`     IS 100000000
        `limit of Benefit 2`              IS 20000000
        `sum insured under Benefit 3`     IS 50000000
        `limit of Benefit 4`              IS 40000000
        `surgery limit within Benefit 4`  IS 20000000
        `room and board limit per day`    IS JUST 1000000
        `basis of the daily allowance`    IS basis
        `days of allowance chosen`        IS 60
        `limit of Benefit 6`              IS 10000000
        `transport level`                 IS level
        `funeral allowance`               IS JUST 5000000

GIVETH A LIST OF `A benefit`
`all seven benefits` MEANS
    LIST `Benefit 1`, `Benefit 2`, `Benefit 3`, `Benefit 4`, `Benefit 5`, `Benefit 6`, `Benefit 7`

-- The full builder: every field a parameter.
GIVEN takesEffect  IS A DATE
      lastDay      IS A DATE
      issued       IS A DATE
      terminated   IS A MAYBE DATE
      employees    IS A NUMBER
      persons      IS A NUMBER
      benefits     IS A LIST OF `A benefit`
      extensions   IS A LIST OF `An extension clause`
      limits       IS A `The limits in the schedule`
      preExisting  IS A BOOLEAN
      waitsVaried  IS A BOOLEAN
      territory    IS A BOOLEAN
      premium      IS A NUMBER
      special      IS A BOOLEAN
      rate         IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `The contract`
`a contract built from` takesEffect lastDay issued terminated employees persons benefits extensions limits preExisting waitsVaried territory premium special rate MEANS
    `The contract` WITH
        `date the contract takes effect`               IS takesEffect
        `last day of the period of cover`              IS lastDay
        `date of issue`                                IS issued
        `termination date notified by the policyholder` IS terminated
        `employees insured`                            IS employees
        `persons insured in the group`                 IS persons
        `benefits in the schedule`                     IS benefits
        `extension clauses in the contract`            IS extensions
        `limits`                                       IS limits
        `cover for pre-existing conditions agreed in writing` IS preExisting
        `waiting periods varied by the contract`       IS waitsVaried
        `territory extended by the contract`           IS territory
        `annual premium`                               IS premium
        `special activities accepted in writing by PTI, with the additional premium paid` IS special
        `rate of exchange agreed, VND per US dollar`   IS rate

-- The usual scenario contract: the calendar year 2026, all seven benefits, the extensions
-- named, a group of the size given, premium VND 3.640.000, USD at 25.000.
GIVEN employees  IS A NUMBER
      persons    IS A NUMBER
      extensions IS A LIST OF `An extension clause`
GIVETH A `The contract`
`a 2026 contract for` employees `employees and` persons `persons with` extensions MEANS
    `a contract built from` (YMD 2026 1 1) (YMD 2026 12 31) (YMD 2026 1 1) NOTHING employees persons
        `all seven benefits` extensions `the scenario schedule` FALSE FALSE FALSE 3640000 FALSE (JUST 25000)

GIVETH A `The contract`
`the plain contract` MEANS `a 2026 contract for` 20 `employees and` 20 `persons with` EMPTY

GIVETH A LIST OF `An extension clause`
`every extension` MEANS
    LIST `the automatic additions and deletions extension`, `the premium payment warranty`,
         `the traditional medicine extension`, `the food or drink poisoning extension`,
         `the strike, riot and civil commotion extension`, `the suffocation and drowning extension`,
         `the hijacking extension`, `the occupational disease extension`,
         `the unscheduled flights extension`, `the murder and assault extension`,
         `the disappearance extension`, `the routine prenatal check extension`

§§ `Insured persons`

GIVEN role        IS A `A role`
      born        IS A DATE
      firstIn     IS A DATE
      continuous  IS A BOOLEAN
      began       IS A DATE
      named       IS A BOOLEAN
      confirmed   IS A BOOLEAN
      mental      IS A BOOLEAN
      disability  IS A NUMBER
      employed    IS A BOOLEAN
      studying    IS A BOOLEAN
      married     IS A BOOLEAN
      salary      IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An insured person`
`a person built from` role born firstIn continuous began named confirmed mental disability employed studying married salary MEANS
    `An insured person` WITH
        `role`                                       IS role
        `date of birth`                              IS born
        `date first insured with PTI`                IS firstIn
        `insured continuously since first insured`  IS continuous
        `date cover began in this period`            IS began
        `named in the list of insured persons`       IS named
        `confirmed by PTI`                           IS confirmed
        `mentally ill or suffering from leprosy`     IS mental
        `degree of permanent disability, in percent` IS disability
        `under a labour, probation or other recognised employment contract with the policyholder` IS employed
        `in a long course of study`                  IS studying
        `married`                                    IS married
        `monthly salary notified`                    IS salary

-- An employee born 1 May 1990, first insured on 1 January 2026, salary 9.000.000 a month.
GIVETH AN `An insured person`
`the employee` MEANS
    `a person built from` `an employee` (YMD 1990 5 1) (YMD 2026 1 1) TRUE (YMD 2026 1 1) TRUE TRUE FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE FALSE (JUST 9000000)

GIVEN role    IS A `A role`
      born    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An insured person`
`a new member` role `born on` born MEANS
    `a person built from` role born (YMD 2026 1 1) TRUE (YMD 2026 1 1) TRUE TRUE FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING

-- An employee who joined on 1 January 2025 and renewed into 2026.
GIVEN continuous IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An insured person`
`the renewing employee, continuously` continuous MEANS
    `a person built from` `an employee` (YMD 1990 5 1) (YMD 2025 1 1) continuous (YMD 2026 1 1) TRUE TRUE FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE FALSE (JUST 9000000)

§§ `Doctors, places and treatments`

GIVETH A `A doctor`
`a licensed doctor` MEANS
    `A doctor` WITH
        `holding a degree and practising lawfully`          IS TRUE
        `recognised by the law of the country of treatment` IS TRUE
        `treating within the scope of the licence`          IS TRUE
        `relation to the insured`                           IS `no family relation`

GIVEN relation IS A `A relation to the insured`
GIVETH A `A doctor`
`a licensed doctor who is` relation MEANS
    `A doctor` WITH
        `holding a degree and practising lawfully`          IS TRUE
        `recognised by the law of the country of treatment` IS TRUE
        `treating within the scope of the licence`          IS TRUE
        `relation to the insured`                           IS relation

GIVEN activity    IS A `A main activity of a place`
      traditional IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A place of treatment`
`a place whose main activity is` activity `, of traditional medicine:` traditional MEANS
    `A place of treatment` WITH
        `lawful and recognised as a hospital`                       IS TRUE
        `lawful and licensed for inpatient or outpatient treatment` IS TRUE
        `in Vietnam`                                                IS TRUE
        `main activity`                                             IS activity
        `a hospital of traditional medicine`                        IS traditional
        `in the direct billing network`                             IS FALSE

GIVETH A `A place of treatment`
`a hospital` MEANS `a place whose main activity is` `treating the sick` `, of traditional medicine:` FALSE

GIVEN setting   IS A `A setting of treatment`
      firstDay  IS A DATE
      lastDay   IS A DATE
      formal    IS A BOOLEAN
      overnight IS A BOOLEAN
      hours     IS A NUMBER
      place     IS A `A place of treatment`
      doctor    IS A `A doctor`
      afterBirth IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A course of treatment`
`a treatment built from` setting firstDay lastDay formal overnight hours place doctor afterBirth MEANS
    `A course of treatment` WITH
        `setting`                       IS setting
        `first day`                     IS firstDay
        `last day`                      IS lastDay
        `date of the diagnosis result`  IS lastDay
        `admitted with formalities`     IS formal
        `stayed overnight`              IS overnight
        `continuous hours in hospital`  IS hours
        `on a doctor's indication`      IS TRUE
        `the place`                     IS place
        `the treating doctor`           IS doctor
        `after childbirth`              IS afterBirth

GIVEN firstDay IS A DATE
      lastDay  IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A course of treatment`
`an inpatient stay from` firstDay `to` lastDay MEANS
    `a treatment built from` `inpatient treatment` firstDay lastDay TRUE TRUE
        (24 TIMES (Day lastDay MINUS Day firstDay)) `a hospital` `a licensed doctor` FALSE

GIVEN day IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A course of treatment`
`an outpatient visit on` day MEANS
    `a treatment built from` `outpatient treatment` day day FALSE FALSE 0 `a hospital` `a licensed doctor` FALSE

GIVEN head   IS A `A head of expense`
      amount IS A NUMBER
      day    IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An item of expense`
`an item of` head `for` amount `on` day MEANS
    `An item of expense` WITH
        `head`               IS head
        `amount`             IS amount
        `date incurred`      IS day
        `with a VAT invoice` IS TRUE

§§ `Events`

GIVEN kind         IS A `A kind of event`
      day          IS A DATE
      inVietnam    IS A BOOLEAN
      external     IS A BOOLEAN
      diagnosis    IS A `A diagnosis`
      existedFrom  IS A DATE
      treatedOn    IS A MAYBE DATE
      knownOn      IS A MAYBE DATE
      indicatedOn  IS A MAYBE DATE
      circumstances IS A LIST OF `A circumstance`
      occupational IS A MAYBE `An occupational disease`
      atWork       IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An event`
`an event built from` kind day inVietnam external diagnosis existedFrom treatedOn knownOn indicatedOn circumstances occupational atWork MEANS
    `An event` WITH
        `kind`                                                   IS kind
        `date`                                                   IS day
        `in Vietnam`                                             IS inVietnam
        `sudden, unforeseen, outside the insured's control and by a visible external force` IS external
        `diagnosis`                                              IS diagnosis
        `date the condition first existed`                       IS existedFrom
        `date of the latest treatment of the condition before cover` IS treatedOn
        `date the insured first knew of the condition or its symptoms` IS knownOn
        `date surgery was first indicated`                       IS indicatedOn
        `circumstances`                                          IS circumstances
        `occupational disease`                                   IS occupational
        `contracted while working for the policyholder`          IS atWork
        `a clear conclusion of a medical authority on the pathology` IS TRUE
        `the direct cause of the death or disability`            IS TRUE
        `from a cause independent of all other causes`           IS TRUE

GIVEN day           IS A DATE
      circumstances IS A LIST OF `A circumstance`
GIVETH AN `An event`
`an accident on` day `with` circumstances MEANS
    `an event built from` `an accident` day TRUE TRUE `another illness or injury` day NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING circumstances NOTHING FALSE

GIVEN day           IS A DATE
      diagnosis     IS A `A diagnosis`
      circumstances IS A LIST OF `A circumstance`
GIVETH AN `An event`
`an illness from` day `diagnosed as` diagnosis `with` circumstances MEANS
    `an event built from` `an illness` day TRUE FALSE diagnosis day NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING circumstances NOTHING FALSE

GIVEN kind IS A `A kind of event`
      day  IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `An event`
`an event of kind` kind `on` day MEANS
    `an event built from` kind day TRUE FALSE `another illness or injury` day NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING EMPTY NOTHING FALSE

§§ `Claim files and claims`

GIVEN submitted IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The claim file`
`a file submitted on` submitted MEANS
    `The claim file` WITH
        `through the direct billing network`                    IS FALSE
        `kind of accident`                                      IS NOTHING
        `a serious traffic accident, fatal or involving a third party` IS FALSE
        `date the claim file was submitted`                     IS submitted
        `date the accident was notified in writing`             IS JUST submitted
        `date the documents were sent`                          IS submitted
        `date supplementary documents were requested`           IS NOTHING
        `date supplementary documents were submitted`           IS NOTHING
        `force majeure`                                         IS FALSE
        `an invoice lumps several kinds of cost together`       IS FALSE
        `documents supplied`                                    IS EMPTY

GIVEN contract   IS A `The contract`
      person     IS AN `An insured person`
      event      IS AN `An event`
      benefit    IS A `A benefit`
      outcome    IS AN `An outcome`
      loss       IS A DATE
      paid       IS A NUMBER
      other      IS A MAYBE `Other insurance`
      fraud      IS A BOOLEAN
      premiumOn  IS A MAYBE DATE
      renewedOn  IS A MAYBE DATE
      renewalPaid IS A BOOLEAN
      file       IS A `The claim file`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a claim built from` contract person event benefit outcome loss paid other fraud premiumOn renewedOn renewalPaid file MEANS
    `A claim` WITH
        `the contract`                                  IS contract
        `the insured person`                            IS person
        `the event`                                     IS event
        `the benefit claimed`                           IS benefit
        `the outcome`                                   IS outcome
        `date of the loss`                              IS loss
        `paid already under this benefit in the period` IS paid
        `other insurance`                               IS other
        `fraud or dishonest declaration by the insured or the policyholder` IS fraud
        `date the premium was paid in full`             IS premiumOn
        `date the request to renew was confirmed`       IS renewedOn
        `renewal premium paid in full`                  IS renewalPaid
        `the file`                                      IS file

-- The usual claim: the premium paid on the first day, nothing paid before, no other
-- insurance, no fraud, the file submitted on the day of the loss.
GIVEN contract IS A `The contract`
      person   IS AN `An insured person`
      event    IS AN `An event`
      benefit  IS A `A benefit`
      outcome  IS AN `An outcome`
      loss     IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a claim under` contract `by` person `for` event `on` benefit `for` outcome `on` loss MEANS
    `a claim built from` contract person event benefit outcome loss 0 NOTHING FALSE (JUST (YMD 2026 1 1)) NOTHING FALSE (`a file submitted on` loss)

GIVEN event   IS AN `An event`
      benefit IS A `A benefit`
      outcome IS AN `An outcome`
      loss    IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A claim`
`the employee's claim for` event `on` benefit `for` outcome `on` loss MEANS
    `a claim under` `the plain contract` `by` `the employee` `for` event `on` benefit `for` outcome `on` loss
